            "type": "text",
            "data": {
              "text": "Samantha — Software engineer with 4 years in full-stack development and machine learning at Google and Twitch. JavaScript, Python, Ruby, SQL; React, Django, Node.js. Hackathon winner. Degree: Computer Science, Columbia.",
