            "type": "text",
            "data": {
              "text": "David — Electrical engineer with 2 years in wearables and embedded systems at Fitbit and Tesla. C, C++, Python; Altium Designer, MATLAB. Published in an AI & Robotics journal. Degree: Electrical Engineering, Stanford.\n",
