            "type": "text",
            "data": {
              "text": "Eric — Full-stack engineer with 7 years building high-performance web apps at Spotify and BuzzFeed. JavaScript, TypeScript, Ruby, SQL; React, Ruby on Rails, Node.js. Spotify Employee of the Year. Degree: Computer Science, USC.",
